    "summary": "Use this before your **ADEPTA SORORITAS TRANSPORT** [Advances](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase). You may reroll its [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) roll. For the rest of the turn, its passengers can [disembark](vsdata:core-rule/disembarking) even after the transport [Advances](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move). Each passenger unit’s exit counts as a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move). The unit loses eligibility to charge for the turn.",
